WEBVTT

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:24.500
You really do like these kinds of 
paintings, don't you, Okakura-san?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.520
Oh, uh...

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.310
Yes.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.130
Are you submitting anything to 
the exhibition that's coming up?

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.480
I was planning to.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.300
What about you, Kishida-kun?

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.960
I'm submitting some photography,

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.140
since I'm pretty sure she'll take 
first prize in the painting category.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.770
I hear her dad is 
financing the exhibition.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.900
Hey! Don't lower your hand!

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:47.770
I'm sorry.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:50.520
For crying out loud, aren't you 
supposed to be a professional?

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:50.520
Charming, as usual.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.110
<b>Is This a Painting?</b>

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:30.700
In modern art, we shouldn't be 
striving for nostalgic romanticism,

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:35.340
but rather styles reaching for freedom 
and a new kind of expression

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.630
like the Mono-ha, anti-art 
movement, and Informel.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.780
We don't stand a chance 
against Higashiyama Yume.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:41.720
I totally feel like giving up.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.780
I'm sure it must be a great story.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.440
She's totally like the modern 
art college student.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.190
She's totally got connections, though.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:53.020
Not to mention her father's the 
politician, Higashiyama Tetsuzan.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:57.010
The fates were too kind to her.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.650
Isn't she in your class, Kiyone?

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:03.370
Yeah, but we've never really talked.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.620
How are her paintings? Is she any good?

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.220
Honestly,

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.330
I don't think she's that good.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.100
Wow, that's harsh, Kiyone!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.090
You're usually so quiet, but 
apparently you don't hold back.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.090
But...

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:22.070
You don't need other 
variables in art, do you?

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.850
Like money and looks... It's unreasonable.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.920
Yeah, I guess. 
That's what I'd like to think.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:32.200
The world's not fair in general, is it?

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.120
This painting...

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:58.290
How to describe it... Mediocre?

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.240
It's not good or bad.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.130
Is it fun painting something like this?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.310
Yume! Did you find it?

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.830
Sorry! I'm coming!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.530
Damn, that woman...

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.880
All she has is her face and money.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:29.030
Anger makes women ugly.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.290
I see.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.190
You're angry about various things.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.800
You're a very earnest person.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.850
There are just some things 
I can't agree with.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.040
I can understand that you 
feel it's unreasonable.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.380
But anyone can change the future

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:01.700
to their liking depending 
on their outlook.

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:04.070
Is that true?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.200
Indeed. For example,

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.820
like this.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.830
Just be honest

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:16.150
about your feelings.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.300
Honest about my feelings?

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.970
Okay, now let me see your back, please.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:32.080
Yes, yes, I can hear your heart.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.060
It means you're healthy.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:34.980
Healthy!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.060
I feel like we're playing doctor.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.930
You're making fun of us.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:45.900
We are respectable researchers 
of Sefiro Fiore!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:50.670
We're in charge of investigating Daemonia 
and of everyone's health assessments, after all!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:51.910
After all!

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:55.910
Right, sorry about that.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.830
Not to mention, we've been told

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.960
to research you very 
thoroughly, Akari-oneetan.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.450
Being able to hear the voices 
of Daemonia is a first!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.290
First!

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.230
We're going to check every inch of you!

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.750
I wonder if Akari-san is okay.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.440
No! Stop!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.610
I'm sure they're just 
fooling around, as always.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.280
Mad scientists.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:22.810
But I wonder if Akari can really 
hear the voices of Daemonia?

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:29.630
I never heard of someone using 
Elemental Tarot being able to do that.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:33.950
But I don't think Akari-san 
would lie about that!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:40.160
Yeah, but it could also just be her 
imagining or hearing things, too.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:40.780
But—

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:41.710
It doesn't matter.

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:46.210
There's no point in being 
able to hear their voices.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.550
Having a demon possess you...

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.640
...just means that you are weak.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:04.620
<i>People try to stay straight as an arrow,</i>

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:07.150
<i>but that's not always right.</i>

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:12.340
<i>At times, I believe that 
it's natural for a person</i>

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:15.160
<i>to be true to their desires.</i>

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.480
<i>This card is a good luck charm.</i>

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.790
If someone sees us like this...

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.180
Would it bother you?

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.180
<i>If you happen to be</i>

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.680
<i>unable to forgive various 
unreasonable things anymore,</i>

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.940
<i>and want to be true to your desires,</i>

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:49.970
<i>I'm sure that card will 
prove to be very useful.</i>

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.870
Tarot cards use the 
spiritual ideology of the

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.710
Kabbalah Tarot as their origin.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:13.270
Humans, the universe, and 
everything that lives on Earth

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:16.150
are formed from the structure 
of this Tree of Life.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.720
That is one of the theories.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:22.250
These 22 paths, when given 
a form, become Tarot cards.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:26.090
These are called the Major Arcana,

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:28.260
and common Tarot Card fortune-telling

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.590
reads the state of the Tree of Life

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:32.970
that everyone is said to have

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.920
and then predicts the futures 
that can happen from there.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:38.750
Ow!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.030
Wake up and listen.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.580
But I've already heard about this

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.210
from Pops back at 
home so many times.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.960
If you get a failing score, 
you won't be allowed outside.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.460
All right, all right, 
I'll pay attention.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:54.260
One of the Tarot Card 
researchers from long ago

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.820
thought about what might

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:59.010
be possible if people could 
control the Tree of Life.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.980
And from that, the Aeon 
Tarot was created.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.360
However, the Diabolos Tarot 
was also created from that,

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.230
the origin of the Daemonia.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:13.490
So Daemonia are Tarot cards?

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:17.110
Technically they are demons 
that are using Tarot cards.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:21.490
By possessing the person, they 
take that person's Tree of Life,

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:24.750
in other words, their 
fate, and change it.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.250
I see... So that's why the card...

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:31.830
And to exterminate the Daemonia,

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:36.010
the Elemental Tarot was born, 
originating from the Aeon Tarot.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.750
The Daemonia multiply by splitting,

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:41.670
and the Elemental Tarot uses heredity,

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:46.290
the proof in the bloodline that 
is passed down for centuries.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.520
Splitting and heredity...

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.980
There's no point in talking 
about this educationally.

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.500
In the end, we're just 
going to exterminate them.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.750
Well, if we are able to hear from 
the people how they turned into Daemonia,

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.530
maybe we can stop the 
splitting from happening?

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.540
Yeah, but...

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.610
Just leave them alone.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.710
People who are possessed 
by Daemonia are weak.

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:12.190
They should be eliminated from this world.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.960
They're people who don't matter.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:17.420
That's not true!

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:21.680
Anyone could be possessed 
by a Daemonia.

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:24.680
There's no such thing as 
a person who don't matter!

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:28.610
Akari-san!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:39.820
I wasn't...

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:44.220
I wasn't able to hear the 
voice of the one person

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.670
I needed to hear the most.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:52.250
I couldn't hear her.

00:10:54.470 --> 00:11:00.020
98, 99, 100, 101...

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:01.840
It's me. Can I come in?

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:06.490
I see this place is dull as ever.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.350
It's better than your room.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.140
I have to have things in 
my room or I can't relax.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.440
Did you need something?

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:15.710
I thought you might be concerned 
about what happened earlier,

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.520
so I came to cheer you up.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:18.990
I'm not concerned about it.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.580
Seems so.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:23.820
Well, you and Akari both seem 
to have a lot on your plate.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.380
I don't know what happened,

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:30.200
but you're probably at odds 
because you both have strong opinions.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.440
Wow, this is amazing.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:11.730
It is.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.890
Kiyone, congratulations
 on getting first prize!

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.300
Seriously! Great job!

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.300
Thanks.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:30.690
So Higashiyama Yume never entered?

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:31.910
You didn't hear?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.570
She got hit by a truck yesterday.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:34.680
You're kidding! Seriously?!

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:36.310
Today's her wake.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.660
Apparently her paintings were so torn up,
 they can't even display them.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:40.820
How sad.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.820
Congratulations.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:48.220
I never thought you'd be able 
to paint something like that.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.740
But is that really a painting?

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:54.580
Huh?

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:03.470
Did your wish come true?

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.370
Because of you,

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.350
I was able to kill the girl 
who looked down on me,

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.310
and people appreciated 
my painting. Thank you.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.150
That's great.

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:24.010
However, that's not enough, is it?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:29.370
You must be desiring more.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.470
The people who ignored you,

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:35.370
the people who didn't appreciate you...

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.670
You want to kill them.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:58.520
Now...

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:00.790
You're free.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.170
Look out!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:29.010
If I could have heard Fuyuna's voice...

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.100
If I could have listened to her...

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.210
Is this Fuyuna's notebook?

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.730
Hey, over here!

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:55.410
Hurry!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.470
Hey, a fire truck! Let's go help!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:35.370
Today will be 50,000 
euros! It's inflation!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.680
Don't get... in my way.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.180
Brat!

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.200
Akari-san?

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.440
Right.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:03.350
Everyone should just die!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.320
You all mocked me!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.360
Die!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.070
Akari-san!

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:19.690
Akari-san!

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:22.350
Thanks, Luna-chan.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.420
Who are you?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.380
What was that voice?

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:29.420
Luna-chan?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.730
If you're going to get in the way, die!

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:37.180
I can hear it, too. 
That person's voice...

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:40.060
What is it that you hate?

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.350
Please tell me. What happened?

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:45.360
Tell us how we can save you!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.110
What are you, a counselor?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.240
How a brat like you can save me?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.190
Laughable.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:58.920
That girl and that guy... 
Everyone is disgusting!

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:01.750
It's only right that they 
died! Serves them right!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.490
I'm sure a brat like you 
wouldn't understand.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.490
There are times that you 
desire something so much,

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.260
you'd kill a person.

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.760
Is that how you really feel?

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:20.060
Desiring something so much that 
you'd be willing to kill someone...

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.600
Do you really believe that?

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:24.070
Shut up!

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:25.150
Akari-san!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:27.880
Luna-chan!

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:31.690
People like you piss me off the most!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.760
You stomp on people's 
hearts with filthy shoes.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.500
People like you don't ever realize

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.900
the people in the background 
are holding everything in.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.620
You can't save anyone!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:48.830
It may be true that I can't save 
anyone just by listening to them.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.630
But I decided that day 
that no matter what happens,

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.390
and whatever may happen, I 
will listen to the voices!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.900
You're just trying to make 
yourself feel better!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:04.600
Akari-san!

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:20.490
Hypocrite! Hypocrite! Hypocrite!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:24.990
You're just going to kill me anyway!

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:27.040
Come on, just do it already!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:29.790
I still haven't heard 
how you really feel.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.830
That doesn't exist!

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:36.220
All people have pure hearts?

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.970
They don't really want 
to do anything bad?

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:43.050
You just want to believe that!

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.270
Don't push that upon me!

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:48.270
There's no way I'll let you defeat me!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:52.020
Since you want to lecture 
me, you should die, too!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:58.420
Why you...

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:20.050
It hurts... Help me...

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.430
People who become Daemonia are...

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:24.050
Seira, wait!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.950
It's because you listen to 
the voices that you falter.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:51.670
So Higashiyama Tetsuzan died.

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:54.970
Yes. It's said that during 
his daughter's wake,

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.460
he died in a mysterious fire.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.250
Cerebrum did well.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.720
We must reward them.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.250
Human souls, sir?

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.720
Don't act like you're surprised,

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:11.180
or you'll be possessed, too.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.520
My apologies, sir.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.210
I will have them readied immediately.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.310
<i>Akari gave me a corsage.</i>

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.550
<i>I want to give something in return.</i>

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.160
<i>I wonder what I should get?</i>

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.840
<i>Maybe something that has to 
do with fortune-telling.</i>

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:35.130
<i>The sun is... bright...</i>

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:40.540
<i>I wonder what I should do from now on.</i>

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:46.940
Akari-san.

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.240
Are you all right?

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.500
You were told some

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.000
really terrible things while 
we were fighting....

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.840
Yeah, but I'm surprised.

00:20:56.840 --> 00:21:00.170
I didn't think you'd be 
able to hear it, too.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:03.460
Itsuki-chan and the others 
were saying it happened

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.390
because I touched you.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:09.190
It might be better if 
you can't hear them.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:12.330
Seira might be right.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:16.190
It just makes fighting 
them harder for everyone.

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:18.790
I'm glad that I heard its voice.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:21.870
It's true that you might not

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:24.050
be able to save anyone just 
by listening to them.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:29.260
But I don't think anything can 
begin without hearing them, either.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.260
Luna-chan...

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.070
You're right.

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:39.010
If we don't listen, nothing will begin.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.780
I don't believe it.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.990
Maybe Luna's just imagining things?

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:45.780
Who knows?

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.760
What do you mean, "who knows"? 
You're always the same.

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:53.790
Maybe eventually you or I will be 
able to hear them in battle, too.

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:56.140
That's pointless. I don't 
want to hear them.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.590
It doesn't matter what anyone hears,

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:01.300
I don't care about the 
Daemonia's voices.

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:06.030
They're maintaining their distance.

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:10.300
Well, at least Akari and 
Seira both have opinions.

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:14.630
I don't have anything.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:41.510
<b>#14 Temperance</b>

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:32.340
<b>Angels going from pot to pot 
without spilling a drop of water are said to symbolize a heart that treasures 
everything as well as frugality and sincerity.</b>

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:28.580
I am Laplace.

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:29.830
I'm Schrödinger, meow.

00:23:29.830 --> 00:23:31.830
Hmph, explanation of the Tarot cards?

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:33.850
Why must we do such a troublesome thing?

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:35.560
<b>The card symbolizes the balance between
 differing emotions and things, as well as 
the ability to calmly, evenly, and fairly adjust
 everything.</b>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:36.640
Just call us Lapschrö, meow.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.770
<b>If you choose this card, you will have the 
ability to have the strength or thoughts
 to calm situations, and you will gain good 
results from such situations afterwards.</b>

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.340
Hey, don't give us a weird nickname.

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:42.470
<b>Ah, Money, Money!
　How Many Sad Things Must Occur 
in This World Due to Money?</b>

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:40.250
See you next time!

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:41.410
<b>However, if the card is reversed, there is 
a possibility that you'll have confusing 
situations or problems and your standing
 and thoughts will gradually get cloudy.</b>
